# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-project-motto
  stage web
  description "Issue #1212 exact motto on project docs, published product metadata and public pages; candidate selection rejects random or exhaustive search."
  run "node scripts/check-project-motto.mjs && node --test rust/tests/web/project-motto.test.mjs"
  justification "The motto and evidence-driven design direction must remain visible in source; mutation controls reject missing slogans and search regressions without claiming live publication."
